        "created_at": "2017-09-29T00:43:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm now assuming that the wacky spaceman on&nbsp;Blackout and Tactics Wrest the Mind is another one of Adam's old characters that just hasn't been given a role yet.&nbsp; Getting late now, though.&nbsp; Maybe he's Tim Cosing, the 10th Scion?&nbsp; We know some of the scions survive Oblivaeon, since Omnitron is still around (albeit in a different form).</p>",
