        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-29T10:36:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Random thoughts:</p><p>Huh, Adam is actually a few years younger than me. I'd always felt like he and Christopher were a few years older somehow.</p><p>Adam has excellent tastes in fandoms. (ReBoot, whoo!)</p><p>I like how Writhe started out as some weird sort of Rorschach-like creepy noir person fighting spy squirrels.</p>",
