      {
        "id": 204961,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-30T13:00:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I always feel a bit sad when Adam complains about his old art.</p><p>He has definitely gotten better in quality, but his composition skills and the personality of his art has always been top-notch. And for me those are what I look for most in artwork; there's far too much art which is pretty from a technical standpoint but is really flat and dull from an actual composition standpoint.</p><p>(I of course won't say no to having both technical quality AND good composition, but if I had to pick which one I was willing to give on...)</p>",
