      {
        "id": 204962,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-01T13:34:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Jeysie you nailed it. &nbsp;I'll take a good story poorly written on beautifully crafted drivel any day. &nbsp;And I'll take Adams old art over a lot of technically better art thwt isn't engaging. &nbsp;I know people who are the opposite though, and yes, both is always better.</p>",
