      {
        "id": 204964,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-01T21:13:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I do admit I think there are some heroes with dialogue that sounds odd/stilted on their flavor text (Nightmist and Argent being the two worst sufferers), but I haven't been disappointed with what actual comics we've gotten. (Part of why I'm excited at getting eventual Prime Wardens scenario comics in Tactics.)</p><p>But there's a different mindset between appreciating how far you've come and genuinely hating the previous stuff you did when it's not actually that bad. Admittedly Adam has the unenviable position as an artist where his early art is a widespread publication rather than tucked safely away in personal or limited release projects and sketchbooks.</p>",
        "post_number": 32,
        "post_type": 1,
